
Conference Top Uploaders v2.1 by Bobo (Mystic/X-Design) & Looby (Insane/X Dev)
==============================================================================
           { + }-New feature(s)         { - }-Removed feature
           { * }-changed feature        { ! }-fixed feature (Bug)
           { # }-Information            { ? }-let me know if this work

Conftop v1.0 (09-18-93 > 10-15-93) - [Private version for my board]
~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
               First version, coded in Arexx by Bobo
                 Private version for my own board!

09-18-93 { + } I started coding this door.
 - ^^ -  { + } Main source for updating uploads in datafiles.
 - ^^ -  { + } Showing output in conference routine coded.
09-19-93 { + } Now using a configfile.
09-20-93 { + } Now showing total upload stats at the bottom.
09-22-93 { # } Optimized the sourcecode :> Now: 6502 Before: 7523
09-23-93 { * } Now using a own sort routine instaid of using WB's SORT.
               Also abit useless code removed (Now size: 6229)
 - ^^ -  { # } Optimized the sourcecode :> Now: 5687 Before: 6229
10-01-93 { ! } You can now choose how many uploaders you want in a conference.
10-02-93 { * } Now using a own showfile routine instaid of using amiexpress's
               that is abit slow.
 - ^^ -  { + } Now configuable playpen paths in configfile.
 - ^^ -  { + } Now changing stat to 'Joining a conf' when running from
               Bull20.txt, and 'Uploading' when running from Filecheck.
 - ^^ -  { ? } Crashed sometimes on A4000/040. Changed some init codes. I
               *think* it works now.
10-03-93 { # } Optimized the sourcecode :> Now: 5439 Before: 6012
               (Alot of useless code & routines removed)
10-07-93 { + } Now you can launch a door after conftop in filecheck.
         { # } ^ NOTE: All type of Doors without AREXX doors works ^
10-10-93 { ! } Didnot give the launched door the right filename.
10-11-93 { * } Changed the output design abit. Now some more chars for
               username and location.
 - ^^ -  { + } Recoded the source so i was able to compile it.

Conftop v1.1 (10-16-93 > 11-02-93) - [Only Availible for Betatesters]
~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
              Still coded in Arexx. First beta-version.

10-16-93 { # } Since Nightshade didn't want to waste his time on coding
               this door in C, i decided to update it abit.
 - ^^ -  { * } Now 50% faster when joining a conference. Conftop are now
               sorting & updating when you have uploaded a file.
10-16-93 { ? } Fixed for multinode systems. Tell me if this works!?
10-17-93 { ! } Didn't create a new datafile if it didn't exists one.
10-23-93 { ! } ALOT of bugs found in the compiled version. Rewritten alot
               of functions to make it work 100%!

Conftop v2.0 (11-02-93 > 12-11-93) - [Only Availible for Betatesters]
~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
  Talked abit with Looby, and we started to make conftop coded in C.
                      Totaly new version...

11-02-93 { + } LOOBY: Coded the mainprogram.
11-05-93 { + } BOBO : Coded the message structure to write messages.
11-10-93 { * } LOOBY: Datafile now in binery.
11-13-93 { + } BOBO : Now displaying total uploads and you can launch a
                      door after.
11-15-93 { + } BOBO : Coded a new object file, since the one we used was
                      to old, and didnot support filechecking.
                      Many thanx to Byteandi for all help!
11-20-93 { + } LOOBY: New reset routine that shows ex. Day: (1/7).
11-24-93 { + } BOBO : Now showing statistics.
11-25-93 { + } BOBO : Displaying statistics is now configuable in the
                      configfile.

Conftop v2.1 (12-11-93 > 02-05-94) - [Only Availible for Betatesters]
~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
 Recoded conftop. Now more optimized and faster. The code size is now
                  about 20k less then old version.

12-11-93 { * } BOBO : Started recoding and optimize conftop.
 - ^^ -  { * } BOBO : Totaly new configuration program coded.
12-15-93 { + } BOBO : Now using SAS/C 6.50. Coool..
12-18-93 { ! } BOBO : Now an 100% working send message routine.
12-25-93 { ! } LOOBY: Now an 100% working fixbytes routine.
12-27-93 { ! } LOOBY: Now an 100% working sort routine.
12-28-93 { ! } BOBO : Now locking msgbase correctly.
01-13-94 { * } BOBO : Some new design improvments.
01-17-94 { * } BOBO : Changed each line to 78 chars, since pc only support max
                      79 chars / line.  Before: 80 chars / line.
01-19-94 { ! } BOBO : Now starting filecheck when user is found in excludefile.
01-29-94 { ! } LOOBY: New sort routine (again!). Optimized and a tiny bug fixed.
01-31-94 { * } LOOBY: New fixbytes routine (again!). Optimized!
02-05-94 { ! } LOOBY: Sort routine bugfixed (again!!)

